{"lesson":{"id":"dl_mwn2h7uys6suf","courseId":"dl_mwn2h7w0a4ehr","order":24,"title":"Das Auto ist rot","nativeTitle":"The Car Is Red","focus":"","level":"","fromLang":"English","toLang":"German","targetLanguage":"de-DE","nativeLanguage":"en-US","speakers":["Lisa","Nico"],"speakerGenders":{"Lisa":"female","Nico":"male"},"sentences":[{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Also … ich sehe was, was du nicht siehst, und das ist … groß und rot .","native":"So … I spy something you can't see, and it is … big and red."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Das Auto.","native":"The car."},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Das Auto ist rot, aber es ist nicht groß, es ist klein .","native":"The car is red, but it isn't big, it's small."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Das Haus.","native":"The house."},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Ja, richtig! Du bist dran.","native":"Yes, correct! It's your turn."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Ich sehe was, was du nicht siehst, und das ist ... groß und klein.","native":"I spy something you can't see, and it is ... big and small."},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Ich glaube nicht …","native":"I don't think so …"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Ah! Ich sehe was, was du nicht siehst, und das ist ... groß und gelb .","native":"Ah! I spy something you can't see, and it is ... big and yellow."},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Das Haus.","native":"The house."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Ja.","native":"Yes."},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Das hier ist die August-Straußberg-Gasse 23. Aber wo ist der Fahrradladen ?","native":"This here is August-Straußberg-Gasse 23. But where is the bicycle shop?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Hier ist kein Fahrradladen.","native":"There is no bicycle shop here."},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Ja, aber wir sind richtig.","native":"Yes, but we're in the right place."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Ich sehe was, was du nicht siehst, … und das ist nicht da .","native":"I spy something you can't see, … and it isn't there."},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Die Adresse ist fal